{
    "_comment": "Seasonal colours. Each sub-season's step is \"multiply\": [r, g, b] on the colour, \"mix\": \"#rrggbb\" with \"amount\" (0 to 1, how far to move towards that colour), both, or \"color\": \"#rrggbb\"; a sub-season left out keeps the colour. The colour given is the one for the sub-season's middle day; clients with Almanac blend the days in between. \"biomes\" entries replace whole channels for the biomes they match (ID or #tag); the first match wins. \"leaves\" is for clients with Almanac: a leaf block is matched by ID, then by #tag; \"steps\" change the colour its own tint gives, \"follow\": \"foliage\" makes it follow the biome foliage palette, \"keep\": true leaves it alone. Untinted leaves never change. Resource packs can replace this file.",
